    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Barawajeanda Yeremiya weah heeda fuga Yahudi aba Babeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh ng'asheega barawajeanda ajeaksa Yeremiya aba Yerusalemu gweargwa mida ghealooniga, ea ashoohoodiga, ea sibanga ea buuneeda sean, ghayi aat Nebukadinesa Babeli nea ghang'eada Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'asheanji gwasin nea abeeda ea niweewa Yerusalemu sugoocheanda was Yekoniya, sea ghaamwat, ea fuga hees bea Yuda ea Yerusalemu, ea gearnoodiga, ea fuga gadiydooschi gidayeeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea barawajeanda ghwaada geadi Elasa orjeeda Safani, ea Gemariya orjeeda Hilkiya, was gea ajeakta Sedekiyaheeda was sugoocheanda Yuda, gaweay Babeli heeda sugoocheanda siguura Nebukadinesa. Nea barawajeanda ghwanyaashtunu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA fuga Israeli, heeda fuga ghayi earuuteawi Yerusalemu, ak geanung' gaweay ghealooniga aba Babeli: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adeasa gealga ak ghoamwanyi jeesinga; ahista booga ak ghoayaaji gichea ghwaheas jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ageesheena ak goojiili diibiga haweega ea gea orjooga, ak goonyeariisi orjoogeagwa gadeemga, nea ghoayeashti haweegeagwa, ak gaygwaji haweega ea orjooga, ooheadiischeena nea adiidu goong'ayiichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agasa nyageadayda aba jeeda mujiineeda aayaadeegwa ghealooniga, amoasha NG'UTAMIIDA aba badaydeaba mujiineani, aba gideaba iinyas nyageadayda eara agooga gajanyagaada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli; Adiidu ghoamwaschi gwareenganeegwa sibanga ea deareemng'ajeega mida jeedeang'wa, nea adiidu gooleeysiit giirgweatka nyaawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba inyeesa gwaramooraseegwa ng'uyeega aba gheawungeasu; nea ea miideajeagu. Gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Iyoanyiichi gweanyeew laadam ea damanamughuush aba Babeli, abeeda gaydabareaseegwa, ak ghaahiichi neajeedeanyu, ak gaydaaghuumneegwa hiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, aniini ghaanali gida eabadayi aba badahuukeagwa, gea bea nyageadayda, maba munyinda, ak ghaahiimneegwa ghusooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gajaguurneani ak gajapkaani amoasha ghawooda, ak gaydealeeyseegwa iit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajagaseadanean ak gajanyasaan; inyas googaseadaneani aba gurooruunatkeagwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajanyasaan, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gaydanung' anyasa nyageadayda ak geaweamneegwa aba jeeda eemoojiga sean ea jeeda ng'eanyoojiga sean ghayi eahooseegwa, ak gaydaaghuumneegwa heeda ghayi earuuteawaneegwa ak ghaanung' aweayeena ghealooniga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agooga nooyeenyi, ‘NG'UTAMIIDA ninyakneasa sibanga aba Babeli.’– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda sugoocheanda apteadawa hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda bea Dawdi, ea fuga sean abiita jeedeaba mujiineani, ea buweadeegeagwa ghayi mooteayeewani ghealooniga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega; Ng'ula, gaydajaksa ng'uta jeeda nyaawa, ea geejeeda, ea geeyooda muy, nea ging'ulayi gaydanung' gawuurji haghweega munyas bea shaboogheecheanda mwoamu eayaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaydaat geeshta aba ng'uta, ea geejeeda, ea geeyooda muy, ak ghoah gichea easit aba jeeda gheambalmoojiga sean bea ng'eanyiida, ak ghoah gida simwaashta, gichea goobeeli fih, gichea eemachiida nea geefool aba bugusta eemoojiga ghayi eahoosi jeenyaawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba mooleeysiina iit ng'asheegeasu, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA, earukuneegwa galeagasean aba ghuusiga fugeasu bea gadiyeeda was sibanga, ak hean ghoaheawi ooleeysiina iit, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.’– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oaleaydiit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, agoogeeda sean earuuteawaneegwa Yerusalemu ak ghaanung' aweayeena ghealooniga aba Babeli: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli, aba badayda Ahabu was orjeeda Golaya ea Sedekiya orjeeda Maaseya, ghayi ramooran ng'uyeega aba gheawungeasu: Ng'ula gaydaahaak saawa geatinga Nebukadinesa was sugoocheanda Babeli ak gayghabwar goosha aba madeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba gisin saawa, gilinyoo gwanda ghealooniga gaygwarukwiida mooshteawi nea gwayeena, “Gagasa ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA uurjeewana Sedekiya ea Ahabu ghayi ghwarda sugoocheanda Babeli,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba gwasin ng'asheega baspaseega aba Israeli, ak gamealuuli sea gadeemga giischeewda nyaawa, ak gwarukwiida ng'asheega ng'uyeega aba gheawungeasu, ng'asheanda ghayi mii dayeesha asina, ng'asheesu ghaanali, nea naaghwaldi ghaang', gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Barawajeanda Shemaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeshiina Shemaya orjeeda Nehelamu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli: “Niijeakti barawajeanda aba gheawungaagu gaweesa fuga sean mida Yerusalemu, ea heeda ashoohoocheanda siguura Sefaniya was orjeeda Maaseya, ea heeda ashoohoodiga sean nea giyeeshi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ang'iing'i ninung' NG'UTAMIIDA una hoorgeeda ashoohoocheanda siguura Yehoyada, ak ghwanung' miineadaysiina gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gilinyoo gaba geaw iiramoaran, gajang'waanya ak giradayi aba ghealooniga ea munyaloalajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasaan anda mii miina gheang'da Yeremiya bea ng'eanyiida Anatoti aba gideaba gagala geaw sibanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba goojeagu iita Babeli, ak gwayi, “Agooga gajoopiidaana ghealooniga gil geaw, adeeksheena ak goopiidi gealgeagwa, abwara madameegeagwa ak ghoayaaji gichea ghwaheas jeeda.”’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
