          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Yeremiya, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajeaksiina iita fuga mida ghealooniga, ak giyeeshi, ‘Nih gida rugu NG'UTAMIIDA gil aba badayda Shemaya was siida ng'eanyiida Nehelamu: Aba gideaba Shemaya niramooraseegwa earapeadi mii deajeagu, ak ea ninung' aghusa ng'uyeega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak aba ng'asheanji gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: Ng'ula, gaydeargweaksa Shemayeeda ng'eanyiida Nehelamu niny sea jeacheangaaschi; ak ea maygwanda eara siyagi jea eapuut aba jeeda fugaaschi jea ghwadaah miyeenooda jea dasisa fugeasu, aba gideaba ninung' ghaheawa buuneeda NG'UTAMIIDA.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.32"
            ]
